Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.61,0:02:13.49,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,SIHIR SANG PENGULANG JELAS ISTIMEWA\N- MUSIM KEDUA
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:31.48,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EPISODE 14: PENGHAKIMAN
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.61,0:23:44.94,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EPISODE 15: LAUT KUNING
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.99,0:00:13.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia Bayangan adalah hukuman\Nyang dijatuhkan oleh sang Dewi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.49,0:00:18.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka yang berada di sana telah melakukan\Ndosa yang layak diberi ganjaran tersebut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lantas, Anda akan membiarkan mereka mati—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini adalah putusan sang Dewi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang benar saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.23,0:00:39.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dewi mana yang mengabaikan pengikutnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:42.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anda ingin mengabaikan rakyat Anda?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.03,0:00:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atas dosamu menentang sang Dewi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku mencabut posisimu sebagai Kardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.83,0:00:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enyahlah dari Gottheim, Wilhelm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.79,0:01:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan begitu, Wilhelm kembali kemari.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.21,0:01:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia benar-benar bodoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.03,0:01:15.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Membuang semua hasil kerja kerasnya\Nhanya untuk melindungi kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.60,0:01:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar bodoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:30.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia pria yang memilih rakyatnya\Ndibanding imannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.53,0:01:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, namanya tidak ada di sejarah kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wilhelm Evernatten.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.29,0:01:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejarah macam apa yang tersembunyi\Ndi Dunia Bayangan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saya Eyulan Lilystyk,\NWakil Komandan Kesatria.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.38,0:01:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada hal yang ingin saya diskusikan\Ndengan Anda, Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:40.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, apa yang ingin kamu bicarakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.95,0:03:45.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik. Saya datang kemari\Nuntuk melapor atas Komandan Azest.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.04,0:03:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat ini, kejahatan di wilayah\Nterus meningkat
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.90,0:03:50.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}seiring bertambahnya jumlah pengungsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu masalah yang perlu dipertimbangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:59.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu adalah salah satu masalah\Ndi Dunia Bayangan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saya kemari untuk meminta persetujuan\Nmengusir pengungsi dari wilayah ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah tindakan itu terlalu drastis?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kejahatan yang meningkat saat ini\Nkebanyakan dilakukan oleh para pengungsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dibiarkan, ini akan jadi masalah\Nyang tidak bisa diperbaiki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua ini demi Evernatten.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.00,0:04:36.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.21,0:04:39.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir, tolong terima suratnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.51,0:04:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.14,0:04:47.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah!\NSelamat menikmati!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:04:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lezatnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:05:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu menyukainya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini rasa yang baru kucicipi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:03.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini teh prem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau suka, aku bisa\Nmenyeduhnya lagi untukmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.29,0:05:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.31,0:05:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku menantikannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:16.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Komandan!\NKomandan Azest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:17.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harap bergegas ke gerbang kastel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:23.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Biarkan kami masuk!\N- Buka gerbangnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.89,0:05:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setidaknya biarkan anak-anak masuk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.10,0:05:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.56,0:05:29.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong!\NBiarkan mereka masuk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukalah gerbangnya!\NAku mohon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.35,0:05:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya ampun...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:34.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir, jumlah mereka terlalu banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dibiarkan masuk,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.65,0:05:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Evernatten akan runtuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak mungkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kita menerima pengungsi sebanyak itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.08,0:05:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}semua penduduk di wilayah ini\Nakan mati kelaparan sebelum musim semi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita sudah kebanjiran pengungsi\Ndari berbagai wilayah lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka sudah menganggap\Nkebaikan Anda sebagai hak mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong buat keputusan Anda, Tuan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.24,0:06:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan usir mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.52,0:06:10.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengusir mereka akan bertentangan\Ndengan keyakinan Tuan Wilhelm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tahu diri kamu, pelayan rendahan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bicara seolah kamu paham\Nkeyakinan Tuan Wilhelm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.65,0:06:21.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang terpenting adalah\Nmelindungi rakyat Evernatten!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Para pengungsi juga tidak ada\Nbedanya dengan rakyat kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Para pengungsi itulah\Nyang membahayakan keamanan wilayah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:28.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cukup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku paham dengan perasaanmu pada mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, pikirkanlah secara rasional.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.96,0:06:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kata-katamu memanglah benar, Desir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pun berharap bisa melakukannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Wilhelm...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayangnya, kita harus menghadapi kenyataan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.27,0:06:57.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Arah pembahasan ini tidaklah baik...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:03.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami harus memperbaiki sejarah ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, bagaimana caranya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang harus kulakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Wilhelm!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:20.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.71,0:07:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saya akan menemukan caranya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.88,0:07:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cara untuk menyelamatkan rakyat\Nserta para pengungsi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.26,0:07:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.35,0:07:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunjukkan apa yang bisa\Nkamu lakukan dalam tiga hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.67,0:07:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betapa tidak berdayanya aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:47.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berbaris yang rapi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagi yang ingin makanan berbaris di sini!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:55.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berhasil mengulur waktu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, apa yang harus kulakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.54,0:08:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Antara mereka yang tinggal\Ndi sini sejak awal,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.12,0:08:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}juga mereka yang kehilangan rumah\Ndan hanya bisa kemari.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja itu akan menimbulkan konflik.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.40,0:08:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus melakukan sesuatu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Duar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?\NApa kamu dipecat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.73,0:08:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak apa-apa...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu?\NSyukurlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.22,0:08:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sendiri?\NBagaimana dengan pekerjaanmu, Lirika?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.40,0:08:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sedang mengirimkan barang!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pekerja keras, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.75,0:08:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Habisnya, aku susah payah\Nmendapat pekerjaan ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:42.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lirika akan bekerja keras!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus bergegas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.85,0:08:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai nanti, Kak Desir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lirika juga seorang pengungsi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:05.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi berkat Jeffran, dia dapat pekerjaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.78,0:09:11.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang punya pekerjaan\Ndan kehidupannya sebelum kemari.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.81,0:09:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harap kami bisa memberi itu\Npada mereka di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.27,0:09:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak bisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.48,0:09:19.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebelum itu, pasokan pangan akan habis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.23,0:09:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami sudah tidak punya waktu lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.78,0:09:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kami hanya bisa mengusir mereka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.02,0:09:41.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiga harinya sudah usai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah menemukan cara\Nuntuk menyelamatkan pengungsi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:50.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Komandan, kita akan mulai\Nmengusir para pengungsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.01,0:09:57.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anda tidak keberatan, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.07,0:10:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kami tidak tahu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa mungkin itu serangan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:19.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Desir!\N- Desir?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.69,0:10:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal tinggal sedikit lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa-apaan mereka ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.49,0:10:54.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hantaman Angin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Romantica!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.64,0:11:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?\NBerisik...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:11.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya kita bertemu kembali, Desir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.41,0:11:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Romantica, syukurlah kamu baik-baik saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.82,0:11:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu juga, Pram!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu juga denganmu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.54,0:11:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Romantica, kereta kuda ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.57,0:11:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Peran yang diberikan padaku\Ndi Dunia Bayangan ini
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.67,0:11:35.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah Pedagang!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:42.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku dengar kalian ada di Evernatten,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan ada banyak pengungsi berkumpul di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.09,0:11:50.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ditambah, ini musim dingin, jadi kurasa\Npasokan pangan kalian pasti kurang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi aku kumpulkan pasokan\Nsebanyak mungkin dan bergegas kemari.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana?\NHebat, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.91,0:12:08.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar-benar menyelamatkan kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.12,0:12:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Romantica!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa reaksimu begini?\NAda apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:16.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar-benar hebat, Romantica!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.59,0:12:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu terlambat sehari saja,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.63,0:12:21.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kami harus mengusir para pengungsi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.30,0:12:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir memang mengulur waktu,\Ntapi benar-benar mepet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.93,0:12:28.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hampir saja, ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memang hebat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.55,0:12:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu berusaha\Nmenanggung semuanya sendirian?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.15,0:12:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar kamu ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:40.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setidaknya kamu bisa\Nsedikit mengandalkan kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tim yang kamu kembangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kamu benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:49.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa lepaskan aku sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:55.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, maaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:12:59.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua info yang aku kumpulkan.\NAda yang membuatku khawatir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.98,0:13:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.55,0:13:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Misi telah mengalami kemajuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:20.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurangnya pasokan pangan telah diselesaikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.09,0:13:23.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan ini rakyat tidak akan lagi kelaparan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan kemajuan dalam misi,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.79,0:13:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kejadian di dunia ini yang telah\Nmenghilang dari sejarah akan diungkap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harap selesaikan masalah terakhir\Nyang akan menentukan hasil akhir
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:35.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dari Usaha Evernatten Bertahan Hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.92,0:13:43.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, aku ingin berterima\Nkasih pada Nona Romantica.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.84,0:13:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebuah kehormatan bagi saya, Tuan Wilhelm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.47,0:13:47.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.46,0:13:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terdapat masalah keamanan publik yang serius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.23,0:13:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat terdengar kabar\Nbahwa pasokan pangan telah tiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan makin banyak pengungsi\Nyang datang kemari!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.02,0:13:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:58.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:14:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah menemukan cara\Nuntuk menyelesaikan masalah
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.61,0:14:03.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}baik bagi rakyat dan para pengungsi?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.57,0:14:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.35,0:14:08.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama, kita perlu tahu\Nmereka berasal dari mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.41,0:14:13.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurut penyelidikan Nona Romantica,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.64,0:14:17.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}mereka kabur kemari dari Kota Suci Gottheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lantas, mereka kabur dari apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.37,0:14:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat ini, Gottheim memajaki\Nrakyatnya dengan berat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.47,0:14:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan membuat banyak rakyat menderita.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ditambah, kasus anak-anak yang menghilang\Nsecara misterius sering terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.78,0:14:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pengorbanan, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.24,0:14:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pajak besar dan orang hilang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.52,0:14:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kecuali kita membawa perubahan\Npada Kota Suci Gottheim,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.94,0:14:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}rakyat yang akan jadi korban\Nakan terus bertambah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.70,0:14:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengubah Kota Suci?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudmu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.96,0:14:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar lancang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu menentang perlindungan\Ndari Dewi Artemis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:05.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan, jangan dengarkan omong kosongnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:09.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.83,0:15:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang kamu katakan memanglah benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:18.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, aku telah mengorbankan nyawa\Ndan hidupku untuk negeri ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.69,0:15:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ingin aku memulai pemberontakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Negeri yang Anda maksud itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}apakah Kota Suci yang memajaki rakyat\Ndan membuatnya menderita?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau negeri yang bisa ditinggali\Nsemua orang dengan bahagia?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang manakah yang ingin dicapai\Noleh Kardinal Wilhelm Evernatten?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:52.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar, Kardinal sepertimu
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.31,0:15:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tidak seharusnya makan\Ndi resto bobrok di Gottheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.47,0:15:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bilang begitu, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.25,0:15:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.16,0:16:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang tertawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:06.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.03,0:16:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masakanku yang terbaik di Gottheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.64,0:16:14.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itu aku ingin memberi\Nmakan banyak orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.02,0:16:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak?\NSeberapa banyak?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:18.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang di negeri ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.25,0:16:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada dasarnya,\Nkarena itulah aku menjadi Kardinal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.88,0:16:27.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kamu benar!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.91,0:16:32.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena itulah aku mengangkat pedangku!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir Herrman!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.03,0:16:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih sudah mengingatkanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.42,0:16:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu layaknya cerminan hatiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa kamu sebenarnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.26,0:16:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.43,0:16:49.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tidak bisa bilang, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.81,0:16:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saya tidak bisa menjawabnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.00,0:17:02.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengarkan aku, wahai Prajurit Evernatten!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.50,0:17:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita berangkat menuju Kota Suci Gottheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.95,0:17:10.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat ini, rakyat tertindas\Ndengan pajak yang berat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.97,0:17:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan anak-anak tak berdosa\Ndikorbankan untuk ritual yang keji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.21,0:17:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini semua adalah perbuatan mereka\Nyang mengeksploitasi
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}keagungan dan otoritas Dewi Artemis\Ndemi diri mereka sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.03,0:17:25.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kejayaan Gottheim telah runtuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.23,0:17:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wahai para pemberani,\Nangkat pedang kalian!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini adalah pertempuran\Nuntuk merebut kembali negeri kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekaranglah saatnya kalian bangkit\Nbersamaku, Wilhelm Evernatten!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.79,0:17:40.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.29,0:17:42.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maju!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.92,0:17:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wilhelm Evernatten bangkit untuk rakyatnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serang!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memiliki potensi yang besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.51,0:18:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kaisar Suci, Wilhelm Ludwig Evernatten.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.05,0:18:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Inilah wujud lain dari sejarah itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.34,0:18:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anda telah menyelesaikan Dunia Bayangan:\NUsaha Evernatten Bertahan Hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:18:58.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Anda akan diberi hadiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:10.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian akan dikembalikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku nantikan hari saat kita\Nakan bertemu kembali...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.35,0:19:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir Herrman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:35.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertama,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.45,0:19:38.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku ingin mengucap selamat dan terima kasih
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.03,0:19:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bagi para anggota akademi\Nyang menaklukkan Dunia Bayangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.51,0:19:45.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terutama pada Tim Bulan Biru
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.25,0:19:49.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang membuat kontribusi besar\Npada kesempatan ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.79,0:19:52.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu kemungkinan lain\Ndari sejarah Evernatten.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau Wilhelm bangkit\Ndan menjadi Kaisar Suci yang baru,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:19:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kekaisaran Suci mungkin tidak akan runtuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.49,0:20:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi nyatanya, mereka ditelan\NDunia Bayangan dan hancur.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.04,0:20:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kita tidak bisa mengulangi sejarah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.99,0:20:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terkecuali satu sejarah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.56,0:20:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir, ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.25,0:20:28.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu teh prem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku janji akan menyeduhkannya lagi, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau kamu tidak suka?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.01,0:20:36.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku membuatnya agak terburu-buru...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.33,0:20:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya sangat lezat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.58,0:20:43.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Desir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.12,0:20:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau berdansa denganku?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.60,0:20:48.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tu-Tunggu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak boleh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.44,0:20:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dilarang menyerobot antrean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.80,0:20:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku payah dalam berdansa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.71,0:20:59.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.03,0:21:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:10.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar aku ajarkan padamu.\NHabisnya kamu selalu mengajariku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, dia merebut Desir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu dulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.88,0:22:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serangan ke Menara Penyihir gagal,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.98,0:23:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita pun gagal merebut Air Mata Lugenelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.52,0:23:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, soal itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.47,0:23:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berkat itu, aku harus kerja lembur!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.41,0:23:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, merepotkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.41,0:23:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terlebih lawanmu Master Menara.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tim yang menangkap Kraiken\Nberasal dari Akademi Hebrion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.75,0:23:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.57,0:23:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu benar?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.13,0:23:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia dikalahkan oleh bocah-bocah itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.79,0:23:27.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, mau sampai kapan kamu diam terus?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, ternyata kamu ada di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya Kraiken itu bawahanmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.95,0:23:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kamu akan\Nbertanggung jawab, Pak Revolusionis?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.40,0:23:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selanjutnya: Laut Kuning.
